# MISSING stub — §10.1 Ex.6(v) (from solutions/Ex6.pdf)

laws boolean

theorem ex6v: (a⇒b⇒¬a) ∨ (b∧c ⇒ a∧c)
    (a⇒b⇒¬a) ∨ (b∧c ⇒ a∧c)         continuing implication
=   (a⇒b) ∧ (b⇒¬a) ∨ (b∧c ⇒ a∧c)   contrapositive and double negation
=   (a⇒b) ∧ (a⇒¬b) ∨ (b∧c ⇒ a∧c)   distributive
=   (a ⇒ b∧¬b) ∨ (b∧c ⇒ a∧c)       noncontradiction
=   (a⇒⊥) ∨ (b∧c ⇒ a∧c)            double negation and indirect proof
=   ¬a ∨ (b∧c ⇒ a∧c)               context
=   ¬a ∨ (b∧c ⇒ ⊤∧c)               identity
=   ¬a ∨ (b∧c ⇒ c)                 specialization
=   ¬a ∨ ⊤                         base
=   ⊤
